Release binaries
----------------

The release binaries are built with the QNX Software Development Platform
8.0, available free of charge for non-commercial use through QNX Everywhere.
They contain no QNX code: at run time they use the QNX libraries present on
the target (libc, libm, libsocket, libcurl, libtracelog) and, for the trace
input, libtraceparser, which you copy from your own QNX SDP. Those libraries
are licensed to you by QNX under their own terms; using rtcollector-qnx on
QNX does not give you any right to QNX software.

rtcollector-qnx makes no claim to commercial use of QNX software.

The binaries include, statically linked:

- zstd 1.5.0 (BSD licence; licenses/zstd.txt)
- libyaml 0.2.5 (MIT licence; licenses/libyaml.txt)

